        "content": "## AI Health Check\n\nSends one short test question to each of the 6 models the **Store AI Engine** uses and lists which ones answer (**Health Report**).\n\nRun it after changing a model ID, or when answers look degraded. A model that fails here is simply skipped by the engine, but fix it soon: every working model is one more backup.",
